+/**
+ * Let transfers read their sockets from inside a long stretch of work
+ * (VitaSurf): script, a style sheet's parse, box construction. Nothing
+ * is handed to the rest of NetSurf until the next ordinary poll, so it
+ * may be called from anywhere but a fetcher's own callback, where it
+ * does nothing. Rate limited, so cheap to call often.
+ */
+void fetch_pump(void);
